00:12:13.130 --> 00:12:15.170
Y-y-yeah, okay!

00:12:16.460 --> 00:12:19.210
"T-t-t-to my beloved Ataru Moroboshi."

00:12:19.210 --> 00:12:23.290
"My heart was, uh, instantly pierced
by cupid's arrow...

00:12:23.290 --> 00:12:26.380
when I first saw you and
your dashing good looks."

00:12:28.880 --> 00:12:31.630
"Mendo is like a bag of garbage
when compared to you."

00:12:32.500 --> 00:12:35.460
"I couldn't care less about him.
Hmph. That stupid jerk."

00:12:33.080 --> 00:12:33.630
<b>TWITCH</b>

00:12:34.420 --> 00:12:34.960
<b>TWITCH</b>

00:12:36.500 --> 00:12:39.290
"You are much more of a hunk
than Mendo could ever be."

00:12:39.580 --> 00:12:42.000
"You are much more of a hunk
than Mendo could ever be."

00:12:42.000 --> 00:12:43.080
"You are much more of a hunk than Men-"

00:12:43.080 --> 00:12:45.000
What are you, a broken record?!

00:12:47.130 --> 00:12:49.790
I'm just reading it exactly as
it was written, buddy.

00:12:49.790 --> 00:12:50.710
Look.

00:12:53.420 --> 00:12:55.580
That handwriting is beyond crude.

00:12:56.130 --> 00:12:57.790
"Otoko Kumino..."

00:12:58.080 --> 00:13:00.380
Th-there's a kiss mark!

00:13:00.710 --> 00:13:02.380
Oh, baby! Come to papa!

00:13:02.630 --> 00:13:03.580
Smooooooooooch!

00:13:02.630 --> 00:13:03.580
<b>SMOOOOOOOOOCH!</b>

00:13:06.080 --> 00:13:09.210
Yahoo! Yahoo! Yahoo! Yahoo!

00:13:09.210 --> 00:13:11.170
What on earth is he so giddy about?

00:13:11.170 --> 00:13:12.130
Hey Lum!

00:13:12.130 --> 00:13:13.710
I feel bad for this pathetic loser.

00:13:13.710 --> 00:13:16.210
He's jumping for joy after getting
one measly love letter.

00:13:16.210 --> 00:13:17.540
LOVE LETTER?!

00:13:17.540 --> 00:13:19.960
Darling! Tell me who
sent you that right now!

00:13:19.960 --> 00:13:23.380
I'm such hot stuff, women practically
throw themselves at my feet all the time.

00:13:23.670 --> 00:13:25.170
Haruuumph!

00:13:23.670 --> 00:13:25.170
<b>HARUUUMPH</b>

00:13:25.420 --> 00:13:26.670
Waaaah!

00:13:26.670 --> 00:13:28.830
I'm so hurt! Booo!

00:13:30.080 --> 00:13:31.380
There, there.

00:13:31.380 --> 00:13:32.920
Gah! That's not fair, Lum!

00:13:32.920 --> 00:13:34.670
Come and cry into my chest instead!

00:13:38.080 --> 00:13:41.750
Darling... don't you feel even a little frustrated
seeing me in the arms of another guy?

00:13:41.750 --> 00:13:44.170
Nah. You two look great together!

00:13:45.000 --> 00:13:46.210
Miss Lum.

00:13:46.540 --> 00:13:49.670
I think it's more than time
that you give up on Moroboshi.

00:13:49.670 --> 00:13:52.460
I mean, look at how much
he celebrated over that fake letter.

00:13:52.460 --> 00:13:54.170
He's nothing but a dope.

00:13:54.170 --> 00:13:56.920
Shut your stupid face!
That letter from Otoko is 100% real!

00:13:56.920 --> 00:13:57.790
Wanna bet on that?

00:13:57.790 --> 00:13:58.630
Gladly!

00:13:58.630 --> 00:14:02.330
All right. If this "Otoko Kumino" woman
turns out to be a sham,

00:13:59.960 --> 00:14:00.960
<b>SHOOOOOVE</b>

00:14:01.960 --> 00:14:02.250
<b>SHOVE</b>

00:14:02.330 --> 00:14:04.710
then I get to take over as class president.

00:14:03.080 --> 00:14:03.540
<b>SHOVE</b>

00:14:04.460 --> 00:14:06.080
<b>SHOOOOVE</b>

00:14:04.710 --> 00:14:07.170
And if she turns out to be real,
then you have to give me 10,000 yen!

00:14:07.170 --> 00:14:07.960
Fine.

00:14:07.960 --> 00:14:10.210
Th-there's no take backsies later, dude!

00:14:10.210 --> 00:14:11.130
Okay.

00:14:11.920 --> 00:14:13.540
Jeez, talk about making a pointless demand...
You heard me say 10,000 right?<b></b>

00:14:13.540 --> 00:14:14.420
Jeez, talk about making a pointless demand...
Yep.<b></b>

00:14:15.460 --> 00:14:17.040
Wh-what're we gonna do?

00:14:17.040 --> 00:14:20.040
That's easy, we just throw our support
totally behind Ataru!

00:14:20.040 --> 00:14:23.380
Okay, sure.
But Otoko Kumino doesn't exist!

00:14:23.380 --> 00:14:25.630
She's just a fictional person
that we made up!

00:14:25.630 --> 00:14:27.460
No doy! Use your head, man!

00:14:28.080 --> 00:14:30.380
You'll pay me 3,000 yen for one hour of work?!

00:14:30.380 --> 00:14:32.380
Yes! I am so in!

00:14:32.380 --> 00:14:33.830
Here's the deal.

00:14:33.830 --> 00:14:36.710
You're going to pretend to be a girl named
"Otoko Kumino" for one hour tomorrow.

00:14:36.710 --> 00:14:39.080
Sure thing! That's a piece of cake!

00:14:42.170 --> 00:14:43.130
HELL YEAAAH!

00:14:43.130 --> 00:14:46.920
She wants to meet me at Cafe Ketaguri
at 4 pm this afternoon! Oh, baby!

00:14:46.920 --> 00:14:49.380
Hmph! This whole thing is ridiculous!

00:14:49.670 --> 00:14:54.000
Any girl who would actually have the hots
for you must be nutty as a fruitcake!

00:14:54.000 --> 00:14:57.710
Good point. But it takes one
to know one. Eh, Lum?

00:14:58.920 --> 00:14:59.960
Whatever.

00:14:59.960 --> 00:15:03.460
I think I'm seriously going to move on
from you and be with Shutaro instead.

00:15:03.460 --> 00:15:04.540
You called?

00:15:04.920 --> 00:15:06.880
You want to be with Mendo instead?

00:15:06.880 --> 00:15:08.500
Are you serious, Lum?

00:15:08.500 --> 00:15:10.670
Yay! He's getting jealous!

00:15:11.170 --> 00:15:13.080
Now that's what I'm talking about!

00:15:13.080 --> 00:15:15.250
Go on! Have fun with Mendo!

00:15:15.250 --> 00:15:16.080
Welcome!

00:15:16.080 --> 00:15:17.710
How could you, darling?!

00:15:17.710 --> 00:15:21.250
I HATE YOUR GUUUUUUUUUTS!

00:15:26.210 --> 00:15:28.130
I wonder what she's like?

00:15:28.130 --> 00:15:30.500
Could she be cuter than me?

00:15:30.500 --> 00:15:31.960
A-are you kidding?!

00:15:31.960 --> 00:15:33.830
The girl we hired to be
Otoko Kumino can't come?!

00:15:33.830 --> 00:15:37.000
Apparently, she's been stuck in bed
with a stomachache since this morning.

00:15:37.000 --> 00:15:39.210
She took the 3,000 yen that we paid her

00:15:39.210 --> 00:15:41.750
and went out to eat pizza, ramen, hamburgers,
meat buns, baked sweet potatoes,

00:15:41.750 --> 00:15:45.130
okonomiyaki, ice cream and some caramel
all in one sitting that really screwed her up.

00:15:45.130 --> 00:15:47.080
Is she a bottomless pit or what?!

00:15:47.080 --> 00:15:48.330
So now what?

00:15:48.330 --> 00:15:49.330
We're boned.

00:15:49.330 --> 00:15:50.790
I'm open to ideas.

00:15:51.250 --> 00:15:52.420
Well...

00:15:52.420 --> 00:15:54.000
It all makes sense now.

00:15:57.000 --> 00:16:00.500
Going on a date! Going on a date!
A date with Otoko!

00:16:00.500 --> 00:16:02.540
S-so hey, Ataru?

00:16:03.830 --> 00:16:08.210
Good news, boys. I'm taking you out for dinner
once I win that 10,000 yen from Mendo.

00:16:08.210 --> 00:16:09.710
O-oh yeah?

00:16:10.960 --> 00:16:14.250
Looks like I'm going to be class president
from now on. I can't wait to get started.

00:16:14.790 --> 00:16:17.580
Yeah, right! You're just full of hot air!

00:16:17.580 --> 00:16:18.540
Nyah!

00:16:18.790 --> 00:16:20.790
Aw crap. I can't bring myself to tell him...

00:16:20.790 --> 00:16:23.790
Y-yikes, if Mendo really does end up
being class president,

00:16:23.790 --> 00:16:26.380
all of us boys are going to be
absolutely screwed.

00:16:26.960 --> 00:16:30.040
I can't be bothered to try
and help him this time.

00:16:30.040 --> 00:16:32.460
He needs to learn his lesson
every once in awhile!

00:16:32.460 --> 00:16:33.670
Hmph!

00:16:40.080 --> 00:16:41.920
Hey, Moroboshi...

00:16:41.920 --> 00:16:44.880
It's already 15 minutes past
when you were supposed to meet.

00:16:44.880 --> 00:16:46.000
Is she really gonna show?

00:16:46.000 --> 00:16:46.880
Yes!

00:16:46.880 --> 00:16:49.040
Come on, dude.
It was obviously just a prank.

00:16:49.040 --> 00:16:50.080
Like hell it is!

00:16:50.080 --> 00:16:52.540
What a shame. She left you out to dry.

00:16:52.540 --> 00:16:54.540
Stuff it. She's on her way!

00:16:55.500 --> 00:16:58.380
Darling must feel like a fool by now.

00:16:58.790 --> 00:17:00.460
That's what he gets!

00:17:07.330 --> 00:17:10.330
Darling, you big dummy...

00:17:16.580 --> 00:17:18.130
Thanks for coming!

00:17:22.330 --> 00:17:24.170
It's been a whole hour...

00:17:25.920 --> 00:17:29.170
Moroboshi. I'm giving you 15 more minutes.

00:17:29.500 --> 00:17:31.460
If she doesn't show by then, you lose.

00:17:36.960 --> 00:17:38.000
But...

00:17:38.790 --> 00:17:41.880
In the end... he's still my darling Ataru...

00:17:41.880 --> 00:17:43.460
and I love him.

00:17:49.380 --> 00:17:52.000
Darling... you poor thing.

00:18:01.250 --> 00:18:02.830
Welp, time is up.

00:18:02.830 --> 00:18:07.960
Ugh. I guess the reign of
President Mendo is now upon us.

00:18:09.040 --> 00:18:10.580
Otoko, my love...

00:18:18.580 --> 00:18:20.500
Sorry to keep you!

00:18:21.580 --> 00:18:24.080
I'm Otoko Kumino!

00:18:28.420 --> 00:18:30.380
Wh-what a hottie!

00:18:32.580 --> 00:18:35.830
Shucks! You had me worried, Otoko!

00:18:35.830 --> 00:18:37.750
You're too much of a tease, baby!

00:18:37.750 --> 00:18:39.210
I'm so sorry!

00:18:44.750 --> 00:18:45.420
LU-?!

00:18:45.420 --> 00:18:48.500
Yes, the LOVE letter!
I'm so happy that you read it!

00:18:49.920 --> 00:18:53.040
Darling! I know you don't want
everyone to make fun of you!

00:18:53.040 --> 00:18:54.330
So stay quiet and keep up the act!

00:18:56.040 --> 00:18:57.420
Squeeee!

00:18:57.420 --> 00:19:01.040
I've dreamed so long about
being in your embrace, just like this!

00:19:01.040 --> 00:19:02.330
Otoko, my love!

00:19:01.630 --> 00:19:02.580
<b>HUG</b>

00:19:02.880 --> 00:19:05.080
All right! Let's go on our date, Ataru!

00:19:05.080 --> 00:19:06.960
I want you all to myself!

00:19:06.960 --> 00:19:08.670
Yeah, let's get going!

00:19:08.960 --> 00:19:11.040
Bye, everyone! It was nice seeing you!

00:19:11.040 --> 00:19:12.130
Later dudes!

00:19:17.460 --> 00:19:20.420
Sunnova...! They totally played me!

00:19:20.420 --> 00:19:23.000
Those friggin' jerks!
I'm gonna get them for this!

00:19:23.000 --> 00:19:25.750
It's all your fault for being
so full of yourself, darling!

00:19:25.750 --> 00:19:27.750
Think of how bad it would be
if I hadn't shown up!

00:19:46.380 --> 00:19:49.790
Dammit! Now I actually owe Lum a favor!

00:19:59.630 --> 00:20:02.750
Hold up. Has Lum always
been this attractive...?

00:20:05.750 --> 00:20:08.960
Well, darling...
I'm going on ahead, okay?

00:20:08.960 --> 00:20:09.750
Huh?

00:20:19.080 --> 00:20:20.130
Hey, Lum...

00:20:21.130 --> 00:20:23.710
Whaddya say we walk together
for just a little longer?

00:20:31.920 --> 00:20:32.920
'Kay!

00:20:38.710 --> 00:20:40.080
What's so funny?

00:20:40.080 --> 00:20:41.210
Nothing.

00:20:41.210 --> 00:20:42.750
Oh, come on!

00:20:43.130 --> 00:20:45.210
It's nothing, I swear!

00:22:19.210 --> 00:22:20.710
A call from daddy?

00:22:21.170 --> 00:22:22.920
Get your act together, missy!

00:22:22.920 --> 00:22:24.880
Huh? What's going on?!

00:22:24.880 --> 00:22:26.380
Ya nincompooooop!

00:22:26.380 --> 00:22:28.790
It's time for our clan's
important annual event!

00:22:28.790 --> 00:22:30.330
Don't tell me ya forgot!

00:22:30.330 --> 00:22:32.960
Oh! That's right! Today is...

00:22:32.960 --> 00:22:35.920
the day of the big showdown!

00:22:46.080 --> 00:22:51.000
<b>Good Day for a Departure</b>

00:22:46.080 --> 00:22:51.000
<b>Oyuki</b>

00:22:46.090 --> 00:22:51.000
<b>Ataru Retires</b>

00:22:46.920 --> 00:22:48.630
On the next episode of Urusei Yatsura.

00:22:48.630 --> 00:22:50.380
That's a no-no!
